  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Portugal: Enhancing Migrants&apos; Integration Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective of this project is to contribute to institutional, administrative, and growth-sustaining structural reforms in Portugal. IOM will assist national authorities in improving their capacity to design, develop and implement reforms in policy areas related to cohesion, fair, sustainable, and inclusive growth, and in particular focus on the promotion of social inclusion and the fight against poverty, income inequality and all forms of discrimination.</narrative>
  </description>
